[126.976832, "o", "de position. Run search. Verify no crash, graceful zero-length path or no-op.\\n22\\t\\n23\\t## Priority 4 — Drag start/end during search\\n24\\t\\n25\\t**Scenario:** Begin search, attempt to drag start/end while animating. Verify state machine blocks drag (only allowed in `ready`/`finished` states). No crash or state corruption.\\n26\\t\\n27\\t## Priority 5 — Wall on start or end position\\n28\\t\\n29\\t**Scenario:** Place wall on start node position. Run search. Expect graceful failure, not crash.\\n30\\t\\n31\\t## Priority 6 — Pause / Resume cycle\\n32\\t\\n33\\t**Scenario:** Start search, pause mid-animation, resume. Verify animation continues from exact paused state with no duplicate or skipped operations.\\n34\\t\\n35\\t## Priority 7 — Restart during search\\n36\\t\\n37\\t**Scenario:** Start search, click Restart before finish. Verify animation clears, new search begins cleanly, no stale colored nodes remain.\\n38\\t\\n39\\t## Priority 8 — JPS diagonal modes not selectable\\n40\\t\\n41\\t**Gap:** Only 2 of 4 JumpPointFinder diagonal"]
[126.976846, "o", " modes exposed in UI. `Always` and `OnlyWhenNoObstacles` missing.\\n42\\t**Scenario:** Document what UI changes needed; build scenario that exercises all 4 modes if dropdown were added.\\n43\\t\\n44\\t## Priority 9 — Bi-directional vs unidirectional comparison\\n45\\t\\n46\\t**Scenario:** Same grid, run A* unidirectional then bi-directional. Verify bi-directional explores fewer nodes; same or similar path.\\n47\\t\\n48\\t## Priority 10 — Weight parameter effect\\n49\\t\\n50\\t**Scenario:** Run A* with weight=1 vs weight=5 on same grid. Higher weight → fewer operations (greedier) but potentially longer path.\\n51\\t\\n52\\t## Priority 11 — IDA* time limit\\n53\\t\\n54\\t**Scenario:** Dense wall grid, set time limit to 1ms, run IDA*. Verify IDA* aborts at time limit with some feedback.\\n55\\t\\n56\\t## Priority 12 — Full grid walls\\n57\\t\\n58\\t**Scenario:** Draw walls everywhere. Run search. Verify robust no-path handling, no JS errors.\\n59\\t\\n60\\t## Priority 13 — Large operation count performance\\n61\\t\\n62\\t**Scenario:** Dijkst"]
