[171.115852, "o", "agonal option variants.\",\"+\",\"+15. **`IDAStarFinder.js`** — `dontCrossCorners:true` combined with `allowDiagonal:true` → `OnlyWhenNoObstacles` (deprecated combined flag).\",\"+\",\"+16. **`IDAStarFinder.js`** — `trackRecursion=true` post-search state: `retainCount` back to 0, `tested` reset to `false`.\"]}],\"originalFile\":\"# Test Writer 2 — Grid.js + AStarFinder + DijkstraFinder\\n\\n## Scope\\nGrid core coverage gaps, AStarFinder constructor/edge-case coverage, DijkstraFinder verification.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Priority 1 — src/core/Grid.js (HIGH)\\n\\n- `getNeighbors` with `DiagonalMovement.Always` — `d0=d1=d2=d3=true` branch (Grid.js:189)\\n- `getNeighbors` with `DiagonalMovement.OnlyWhenNoObstacles` — `d = s3 && s0` branch (Grid.js:180)\\n- `getNeighbors` with invalid `diagonalMovement` → should throw `'Incorrect value of diagonalMovement'` (Grid.js:195)\\n- `_buildNodes` with mismatched matrix dimensions → should throw `'Matrix size does not fit'` (Grid.js:66)\\n- `clone()` — verify cloned grid has identica"]
