[185.240478, "o", "iately true; path is `expandPath(backtrace(endNode))` = `[[x,y]]`.\",\"+\",\"+14. **`JumpPointFinder.js` (factory)** — invalid `diagonalMovement` value (e.g. `999`). No else/throw; returns `undefined`. Verify behavior.\"]}],\"originalFile\":\"# Test Writer 3 — BestFirst + BreadthFirst + All Bi-directional Finders\\n\\n## Scope\\nBestFirstFinder, BreadthFirstFinder, and all four bi-directional finders (BiAStar, BiBreadthFirst, BiDijkstra, BiBestFirst).\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Priority 1 — src/finders/BiAStarFinder.js (HIGH)\\n\\n- All constructor options (same gaps as AStarFinder: allowDiagonal, dontCrossCorners, diagonalMovement, weight, heuristic)\\n- No-path scenario → `[]`\\n- `biBacktrace(node, neighbor)` meeting-point path join — start-side expansion finds end-side node\\n- `biBacktrace(neighbor, node)` reverse direction join — end-side expansion finds start-side node\\n- Both expansion directions meeting explicitly asserted\\n\\n## Priority 2 — src/finders/BestFirstFinder.js (MEDIUM)\\n\\n- Custom heuristic injection\\n- "]
[185.240496, "o", "No-path scenario → `[]`\\n- Constructor option coverage (same as AStarFinder)\\n- The `* 1000000` scaling effect: on open grid, path should be greedy (go straight toward goal)\\n\\n## Priority 3 — src/finders/BreadthFirstFinder.js (MEDIUM)\\n\\n- Diagonal movement enabled variants\\n- No-path scenario → `[]`\\n- Start == End\\n- Constructor `allowDiagonal` / `dontCrossCorners` / `diagonalMovement` options\\n\\n## Priority 4 — src/finders/BiBreadthFirstFinder.js (MEDIUM)\\n\\n- Diagonal movement variants\\n- No-path scenario → `[]`\\n- `biBacktrace` call from end-side expansion (BiBreadthFirstFinder.js:100)\\n- Start == End\\n\\n## Priority 5 — src/finders/BiDijkstraFinder.js (MEDIUM)\\n\\n- Same gaps as BiAStarFinder + DijkstraFinder combined\\n- No-path scenario → `[]`\\n- Verify uniform cost behavior\\n\\n## Priority 6 — src/finders/BiBestFirstFinder.js (MEDIUM)\\n\\n- Same gaps as BestFirstFinder + bi-directional meeting logic\\n- No-path scenario → `[]`\\n\",\"userModified\":false}}\r\n"]
