[219.019193, "o", "weight=5. Verify fewer operations with higher weight.\\n\\n17. **Orthogonal JPS vs BFS** — obstacles, no diagonal. Verify same path length, fewer JPS nodes.\\n\\n### Priority 4 — Missing UI Features (Document Only)\\n\\n18. **Missing JPS diagonal modes** — `Always` and `OnlyWhenNoObstacles` not in UI. Document that `JumpPointFinder` factory supports them but panel has no entry point.\\n\\n19. **Animation speed not configurable** — hardcoded 300 ops/sec at `controller.js:95`.\\n\\n20. **Grid size not configurable** — hardcoded 64×36 at `controller.js:94`.\\n\",\"structuredPatch\":[{\"oldStart\":1,\"oldLines\":66,\"newStart\":1,\"newLines\":55,\"lines\":[\"-# Scenario Builder — Visual & UI Test Scenarios\",\"+# Scenario Builder — Visual Test Scenarios\",\" \",\"-## Scope\",\"-Build test scenarios for the visual demo app based on gaps identified in the visual audit.\",\"+## Source: Visual audit report (`visual-auditor/output/visual-gaps.md`)\",\" \",\"+Build test scenario definitions for the visual demo app. Each scenario should specif"]
[219.019211, "o", "y grid layout, start/end positions, algorithm config, and expected observable behavior.\",\"+\",\" ---\",\" \",\"-## Priority 1 — Bug: IDA* heuristic reads wrong radio group\",\"+### Priority 1 — Bug Validation Scenarios\",\" \",\"-**File:** `visual/js/panel.js:160`\",\"-**Bug:** Reads `input[name=jump_point_heuristic]` instead of `input[name=ida_heuristic]`\",\"-**Scenario:** Select IDA*, pick Euclidean in IDA* panel, run search. Verify heuristic actually used matches selection, not JPS panel.\",\"+1. **CSS hover selector typo** (`style.css:59`) — `#hide_instruction:hover` missing 's'. Verify hover underline never applies on `#hide_instructions` link.\",\" \",\"-## Priority 2 — No \\\"path not found\\\" feedback\",\"+2. **Instructions panel cannot be re-shown** — `#hide_instructions` click calls `slideUp()` with no toggle. Verify panel gone for session after dismiss.\",\" \",\"-**File:** `visual/js/view.js:245`\",\"-**Scenario:** Surround start node with walls. Run any algorithm. Verify user gets clear \\\"No path found\\\" message inste"]
