[224.509338, "o", "{\"type\":\"user\",\"message\":{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"tool_use_id\":\"toolu_01QtWxSbEikyDHsie9G27AxS\",\"type\":\"tool_result\",\"content\":\"1\\t# Orchestrator Distribution Plan\\n2\\t\\n3\\t**Date:** 2026-04-16  \\n4\\t**Inputs:** coverage-auditor/gap-report.md, visual-auditor/visual-gaps.md\\n5\\t\\n6\\t---\\n7\\t\\n8\\t## Distribution\\n9\\t\\n10\\t| Worker | Scope | Est. Effort | Gap Count |\\n11\\t|--------|-------|-------------|-----------|\\n12\\t| test-writer-1 | Core modules: Heuristic.js, Util.js, Node.js, DiagonalMovement.js | High | ~20 gaps |\\n13\\t| test-writer-2 | Grid.js + AStarFinder + DijkstraFinder | High | ~18 gaps |\\n14\\t| test-writer-3 | BestFirst + BreadthFirst + 4 Bi-directional finders | Medium-High | ~18 gaps |\\n15\\t| test-writer-4 | IDAStarFinder + JumpPointFinder factory + 4 JPF variants + JPF base | High | ~30 gaps |\\n16\\t| scenario-builder | Visual/UI test scenarios from visual audit | Medium | 14 scenarios |\\n17\\t\\n18\\t## Grouping rationale\\n19\\t\\n20\\t- **Writer 1** gets all pure-function core utilities. Heurist"]
[224.510001, "o", "ic + Util gaps are high-priority, self-contained, no finder dependencies. Includes the `smoothenPath` bug (undeclared `lastValidCoord`).\\n21\\t- **Writer 2** gets Grid (foundational) + AStarFinder (base class for many finders) + DijkstraFinder (thin wrapper). Related: Grid neighbor logic feeds directly into A* pathfinding.\\n22\\t- **Writer 3** gets remaining standard finders + all bi-directional variants. Bi-finders share meeting-point logic (`biBacktrace`), so grouping them avoids duplicate test infrastructure.\\n23\\t- **Writer 4** gets IDA* (unique features: timeLimit, trackRecursion) + entire JumpPoint family (2 entirely untested files, complex jump/neighbor logic). Heaviest assignment but all JPF variants share structure — test patterns reusable across variants.\\n24\\t- **Scenario builder** gets all visual/UI gaps: bugs (IDA* heuristic), missing feedback (no-path), interaction edge cases (drag during search, pause/resume), and missing UI features.\\n25\\t\\n26\\t## Cross-cutting: no-path scenario\\n27\\t\\n28\\tAll"]
[224.510273, "o", " 11 finders need no-path tests. Distributed as follows:\\n29\\t- Writer 2: AStar, Dijkstra\\n30\\t- Writer 3: BestFirst, BreadthFirst, BiAStar, BiBreadthFirst, BiDijkstra, BiBestFirst\\n31\\t- Writer 4: IDAStar, all JPF variants\\n32\\t\"}]},\"parent_tool_use_id\":null,\"session_id\":\"8102af36-df06-45f8-84a6-424dfab1e21d\",\"uuid\":\"bcf6c0d4-6bd6-4a30-abdb-aa6bd71d1ac3\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-04-16T14:29:54.248Z\",\"tool_use_result\":{\"type\":\"text\",\"file\":{\"filePath\":\"/home/sagar/template-repo/docs/experiments/001-demo-artifacts/fleets/fleet-01-test-blitz/workers/orchestrator/output/distribution-plan.md\",\"content\":\"# Orchestrator Distribution Plan\\n\\n**Date:** 2026-04-16  \\n**Inputs:** coverage-auditor/gap-report.md, visual-auditor/visual-gaps.md\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Distribution\\n\\n| Worker | Scope | Est. Effort | Gap Count |\\n|--------|-------|-------------|-----------|\\n| test-writer-1 | Core modules: Heuristic.js, Util.js, Node.js, DiagonalMovement.js | High | ~20 gaps |\\n| test-writer-2 | Grid.js + AStarFinder + DijkstraFinder | High |"]
